        - Output: :math:`(*)`. Output is of the same shape as input

    Examples::

        >>> m = nn.Dropout(p=0.2)
        >>> input = torch.randn(20, 16)
        >>> output = m(input)

    .. _Improving neural networks by preventing co-adaptation of feature
        detectors: https://arxiv.org/abs/1207.0580

